{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13108080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13108080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310808001:0":{"text":"ま、待ってください！","source_cn":"请——请等等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA9C55157AE0D38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310808002:0":{"text":"ほ、本当にあなたがあの、あの女将軍！？","source_cn":"你真的是那位女将军，是祭典上纪念的那位英雄？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40AC6CE5A3B7391A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310808003:1":{"text":"見ての通りよ。","source_cn":"你所见的就是你所见的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55394FF60F76402E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310808004:0":{"text":"カタストロフと戦った英雄が、なぜグレイヴボーンに……","source_cn":"你不是对抗恶魔的英雄吗， 为什么会变成亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87DD89B5C2954EC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1310808005:0":{"text":"一体何が？……あなたたち生きた屍は本当にループとは無関係なのですか？","source_cn":"你身上究竟发生了什么事？你……活死人真的和时间循环没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5DA21FC5692A898","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1310808005":{"text":"一体何が？……あなたたち生きた屍は本当にループとは無関係なのですか？","source_cn":"你身上究竟发生了什么事？你……活死人真的和时间循环没有关系吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5DA21FC5692A898","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1310808006:1":{"text":"ふふ……将軍、英雄、生きた屍……もううんざり。どれも本当の私なんかじゃない、私の名前は、ヴェリカよ。","source_cn":"呵……将军、英雄、活死人……我受够这些词了。它们都不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8A2CFCFE06CAB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1310808007:0":{"text":"二千年前、私はカタストロフと戦った……騎士だった私は、命に代えても民を守ると誓ったの。それは死んでも変わらないわ！","source_cn":"没错，我曾经和恶魔战斗过，在两千年以前……我曾是个骑士...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65CC87D36155B37C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310808008:0":{"text":"たとえこの身がグレイヴボーンに、あなたたちの言う汚らわしい「生きた屍」になっても、私は決して人々に危害を加えたりはしない！","source_cn":"所以，你们听好了：即便我现在是亡灵，是你们口中污秽可怖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E2AA90E5A8B20D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310808009:0":{"text":"私やここの屍たちは、カタストロフの眷族なんかじゃないわ！","source_cn":"我不是什么恶魔的眷属，这里所有的活死人都不是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0713F7669A8051E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1310808010:1":{"text":"でも町民たちはみんな、カタストロフの配下だって……","source_cn":"但是雪松镇的镇民说，活死人是恶魔的属下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35070768B495E29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1310808011:0":{"text":"……生きた屍がどうやって生まれたのか知ってる？","source_cn":"……你们知道这里的活死人是怎么来的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2DE180BC03C8CEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1310808012:0":{"text":"い、いいえ……","source_cn":"呃，不、不知道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF51171DB3AA1C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1310808013:1":{"text":"知りたいならついてきて、あなたたちに真相を教えてあげる。","source_cn":"跟我来吧，如果你们必须要一个解释，那我就给你们真相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F0B9DEEC9A71D74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"（相手の返答を待つ）","source_cn":"（等待她的回答）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D3621375CBACF2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（相手の返答を待つ）","female":"（相手の返答を待つ）","variant_male_record_index":"68772","variant_female_record_index":"68773","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker: